-86c5-2dfa9d9d11d3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "175ef2ae-4064-5df6-a17e-4f826d7df838" :question/id #uuid "175ef2ae-4064-5df6-a17e-4f826d7df838"] [:db/add "175ef2ae-4064-5df6-a17e-4f826d7df838" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "175ef2ae-4064-5df6-a17e-4f826d7df838" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 2=\\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "175ef2ae-4064-5df6-a17e-4f826d7df838" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "175ef2ae-4064-5df6-a17e-4f826d7df838" :question/answer-fields "aa8d3463-8288-5beb-86c5-2dfa9d9d11d3"] [:db/ensure "175ef2ae-4064-5df6-a17e-4f826d7df838" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "175ef2ae-4064-5df6-a17e-4f826d7df838"] [:db/add "d4e4c3ee-ca1c-5b3c-b345-772e9140b95e" :answer/id #uuid "d4e4c3ee-ca1c-5b3c-b345-772e9140b95e"] [:db/add "d4e4c3ee-ca1c-5b3c-b345-772e9140b95e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d4e4c3ee-ca1c-5b3c-b345-772e9140b95e" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "d4e4