$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "6f3ddf0d-e8b9-51fc-8fad-aee93d041c89" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6f3ddf0d-e8b9-51fc-8fad-aee93d041c89" :question/answer-fields "45fcb789-8fed-5301-9d09-467e44966785"] [:db/ensure "6f3ddf0d-e8b9-51fc-8fad-aee93d041c89" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "6f3ddf0d-e8b9-51fc-8fad-aee93d041c89"] [:db/add "ceffb3b0-6c92-55c1-910d-e858acebd073" :answer/id #uuid "ceffb3b0-6c92-55c1-910d-e858acebd073"] [:db/add "ceffb3b0-6c92-55c1-910d-e858acebd073" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ceffb3b0-6c92-55c1-910d-e858acebd073" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "ceffb3b0-6c92-55c1-910d-e858acebd073" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6440cfd1-5a2f-5c18-a0a5-185e9b418435" :answer/id #uuid "6440cfd1-5a2f-5c18-a0a5-185e9b418435"] [:db/add "6440cfd1-5a2f-5c18-a0a5-185e9b418435" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6440cfd1-5a2f-5c18-a0a5-185e9b418435" :answer/value "\\frac{6}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "6440cfd1-5a2f-5c18-a0a5-185e9b418435" :answer/validate] [:db/add "50e06f67-a04f-5a53-a840-adaf9741bb01" :answer/id #uuid "50e06f67-a04f-5a53-a840-adaf9741bb01"] [:db/add "50e06f67-a04f-5a53-a840-adaf9741bb01" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "50e06f67-a04f-5a53-a840-adaf9741bb01" :answer/value