d "2071ef75-3ba7-54a9-bd04-476183fbd47f"] [:db/add "2071ef75-3ba7-54a9-bd04-476183fbd47f" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "2071ef75-3ba7-54a9-bd04-476183fbd47f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 25=25\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{5})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=5\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{25}\\cdot 5=\\frac{3}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "2071ef75-3ba7-54a9-bd04-476183fbd47f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "2071ef75-3ba7-54a9-bd04-476183fbd47f" :question/answer-fields "1189176a-452e-507e-8347-a750813f29e5"] [:db/ensure "2071ef75-3ba7-54a9-bd04-476183fbd47f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "2071ef75-3ba7-54a9-bd04-476183fbd47f"] [:db/add "0eb812ed-0c3f-5b4e-a070-c99db828e77e" :answer/id #uuid "0eb812ed-0c3f-5b4e-a070-c99db828e77e"] [:db/add "0eb812ed-0c3f-5b4e-a070-c99db828e77e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0eb812ed-0c3f-5b4e-a070-c99db828e77e" :answer/value "- \\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "0eb812ed-0c3f-5b4e-a070-c99db828e77e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8981360e-a973-59ae-803e-1b45bf7d27ad" :a