] [:db/add "dd006e14-974d-5e4d-8cca-d3c8dd909b34" :answer-field/choices "8adf6440-278c-5de5-b3f5-f57b6a18fff1"] [:db/add "dd006e14-974d-5e4d-8cca-d3c8dd909b34" :answer-field/choices "ea7f26ca-5b92-559a-bde2-c66789ccfcd8"] [:db/add "dd006e14-974d-5e4d-8cca-d3c8dd909b34" :answer-field/choices "5177280c-3786-5d15-97df-6cea6974ac13"] [:db/add "dd006e14-974d-5e4d-8cca-d3c8dd909b34" :answer-field/correct "ea7f26ca-5b92-559a-bde2-c66789ccfcd8"] [:db/ensure "dd006e14-974d-5e4d-8cca-d3c8dd909b34" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8b3918f5-78fb-5fb5-9645-bfe0e6ea1b79" :question/id #uuid "8b3918f5-78fb-5fb5-9645-bfe0e6ea1b79"] [:db/add "8b3918f5-78fb-5fb5-9645-bfe0e6ea1b79" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "8b3918f5-78fb-5fb5-9645-bfe0e6ea1b79" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot 3=\\frac{2}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "8b3918f5-78fb-5fb5-9645-bfe0e6ea1b79" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8b3918f5-78fb-5fb5-9645-bfe0e6ea1b79" :question/answer-fields "dd006e14-974d-5e4d-8cca-d3c8dd909b34"] [:db/ensure "8b3918f5-78fb-5fb5-9645-bfe0e6ea1b79" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "8b3918f5-78fb-5fb5-9645-bfe0e6ea1b79"] [:db/add "c1cc9c7a-e19d-589f-994f-36d0ba5c886a" :answer/id #uuid "c1cc9c7a-e19d-589f-994f-36d0ba5c886a"] [:db/add "c1cc9c7a-e19d-589f-994f-36d0ba5c886a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c1cc9c7a-e19d-589f-994f-36d0ba5c886a" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "c1cc9c7a-e19d-589f-994f-36d0ba5c886a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "95692b39-2394-5db9-b51e-2a755210f200" :answer/id #uuid "95692b39-2394-5db9-b51e-2a755210f200"] [:db/add "95692b39-2394-5db9-b51e-2a755210f200" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "95692b39-2394-5db9-b51e-2a755210f200" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "95692b39-2394-5db9-b51e-2a755210f200" :answer/validate] [:db/add "28de3e5c-c14d-59a7-bf4e-b25b415b7209" :answer/id #uuid "28de3e5c-c14d-59a7-bf4e-b25b415b7209"] [:db/add "28de3e5c-c14d-59a7-bf4e-b25b415b7209" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "28de3e5c-c14d-59a7-bf4e-b25b415b7209" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "28de3e5c-c14d-59a7-bf4e-b25b415b7209" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ea57a11d-0aa1-5d92-b3f2-59d34c75926d" :answer/id #uuid "ea57a11d-0aa1-5d92-b3f2-59d34c75926d"] [:db/add "ea57a11d-0aa1-5d92-b3f2-59d34c75926d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ea57a11d-0aa1-5d92-b3f2-59d34c75926d" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "ea57a11d-0aa1-5d92-b3f2-59d34c75926d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "62596052-89d3-5f9b-a58e-1f4d3aa495cb" :answer/id #uuid "62596052-89d3-5f9b-a58e-1f4d3aa495cb"] [:db/add "62596052-89d3-5f9b-a58e-1f4d3aa495cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "62596052-89d3-5f9b-a58e-1f4d3aa495cb" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "62596052-89d3-5f9b-a58e-1f4d