-solution "Let $u=\\frac{4 x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{4}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n16 x^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{4 x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{3}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{16 x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1b0c77f3-99b9-548e-a9b2-aac1b610424c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1b0c77f3-99b9-548e-a9b2-aac1b610424c" :question/answer-fields "f9afc218-8758-5e57-b24f-9eb5bc1eb19a"] [:db/ensure "1b0c77f3-99b9-548e-a9b2-aac1b610424c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "1b0c77f3-99b9-548e-a9b2-aac1b610424c"] [:db/add "31a59211-8db1-5edb-8d0d-0d650063e01c" :answer/id #uuid "31a59211-8db1-5edb-8d0d-0d650063e01c"] [:db/add "31a59211-8db1-5edb-8d0d-0d650063e01c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "31a59211-8db1-5edb-8d0d-0d650063e01c" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{10}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "31a59211-8db1-5edb-8d0d-0d650063e01c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5071cb34-6f09-54ea-9e23-65f91e1f966e" :answer/id #uuid "5071cb34-6f09-54ea-9e23-65f91e1f966e"] [:db/add "5071cb34-6f09-54ea-9e23-65f91e1f966e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5071cb34-6f09-54ea-9e23-65f91e1f966e" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "5071cb34-6f09-54ea