de factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{8}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{16 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "2e5371db-b313-5e18-b35c-a5b7b750f355" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "2e5371db-b313-5e18-b35c-a5b7b750f355" :question/answer-fields "4a7f7d13-324a-59aa-a994-4b4ef64c36e6"] [:db/ensure "2e5371db-b313-5e18-b35c-a5b7b750f355" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "2e5371db-b313-5e18-b35c-a5b7b750f355"] [:db/add "cdb729d9-7ea3-56c8-a22a-ebe3f1fa259c" :answer/id #uuid "cdb729d9-7ea3-56c8-a22a-ebe3f1fa259c"] [:db/add "cdb729d9-7ea3-56c8-a22a-ebe3f1fa259c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cdb729d9-7ea3-56c8-a22a-ebe3f1fa259c" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "cdb729d9-7ea3-56c8-a22a-ebe3f1fa259c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f71e3086-e41b-59bf-aa9d-c186b82dc9ff" :answer/id #uuid "f71e3086-e41b-59bf-aa9d-c186b82dc9ff"] [:db/add "f71e3086-e41b-59bf-aa9d-c186b82dc9ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f71e3086-e41b-59bf-aa9d-c186b82dc9ff" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{12}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "f71e3086-e41b-59bf-aa9d-c186b82dc9ff" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5bf15fd4-3dc7-5415-98f4-5338407bf0fc" :answer/id #uuid "5bf15fd4-3dc7-5415-98f4-5338407bf0fc"] [:db/add "5bf15fd4-3dc7-5415-98f4-5338407bf0fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5bf15fd4-3dc7-5415-98f4-5338407bf0fc" :answer/value "- \\