22967702-d9fa-58b6-9c26-8a737978cc3c"] [:db/add "22967702-d9fa-58b6-9c26-8a737978cc3c" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "22967702-d9fa-58b6-9c26-8a737978cc3c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n9 x^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{3 x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{4}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot \\frac{4}{3}=\\frac{1}{6}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "22967702-d9fa-58b6-9c26-8a737978cc3c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "22967702-d9fa-58b6-9c26-8a737978cc3c" :question/answer-fields "47493057-ea16-512f-857e-094a2a6b41e1"] [:db/ensure "22967702-d9fa-58b6-9c26-8a737978cc3c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "22967702-d9fa-58b6-9c26-8a737978cc3c"] [:db/add "0cb7d224-4974-554e-8874-126df86b7692" :answer/id #uuid "0cb7d224-4974-554e-8874-126df86b7692"] [:db/add "0cb7d224-4974-554e-8874-126df86b7692" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0cb7d224-4974-554e-8874-126df86b7692" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "0cb7d224-4974-554e-8874-126df86b7692" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6167bbf9-bc26-